  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "0.5 cup powdered sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 cup very finely chopped pecans",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.33333334326744 cup powdered sugar, or more as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j_FF59DwvDTFU08tvXFk-Umj2oo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-Step-1-5dc9465198ca414e949cfa7cde0448cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter, 1/2 cup confectioners' sugar, and vanilla extract together with an electric mixer in a large bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xnyTVW4qQ-TMWkfcCIysT2kWxg0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-step-2-96a12570b2344a158f713ba7cc6a9295.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually mix in flour, pecans, and salt until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/js9lzVFEH_DTDMTr7DiPvhzQKVI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-step-3-e9234f037efb4e6f9982188dc1fa272d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into walnut-sized balls and place 2 inches apart on ungreased baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H9uXpqY6LRlF5M26HYjSRNsmoVo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-step-4-c34c4a4f349a45109f7cbb5c263f0215.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until bottoms are light golden brown; tops should remain pale, 12 to 15 minutes. Try not to let cookies get too brown: it's better to undercook them than to overcook them.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2MdClKZyQicPIessFh7OjRvM8So=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-step-5-ff6b304b96414060ac16a2044c3cce01.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let sit on the baking sheets to cool slightly, then transfer to wire racks until warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G6kGYtL1FhUnMyUZks3-BH0vqzA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-step-6-6bb0cdfdb1ab475bba2716e7d51f626e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 1/3 cup confectioners' sugar in a shallow bowl; roll warm cookies in sugar to coat; return to the wire racks to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jK5SyWCWMezdQAGcopUVm_1xLS8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-step-7-47d4cc408cb34dde91e3698f3742b89c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll confectioners' sugar once more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GlbGRV8VvnzrSQyQ9UDH8b_PZxQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-11171-snowballs-ii-ddmfs-4x3-8e25226892ba420a8265ea83958cd488.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11171/step_08.webp"
    }
